<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 110,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 110,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est 110,000, Wk ago 115,000, Yr ago 105,000 head. Barrows and gilts traded steady compared with mid-session Tuesday. Trade was moderate for moderate demand and offerings. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				 Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-260 lbs     50.50 -51.50	   51.50 -52.50</p>
<p>few			    50.00  52.00	   51.00  53.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   260-280 lbs     48.50 -51.50	   49.00 -52.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   280-300 lbs     45.00 -50.00	   45.50 -51.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs.    40.00 -43.00	   41.00 -45.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   450-500 lbs.    44.00 -45.00	   45.00 -46.00</p>
<p>US 1-3   500 lbs. up     47.00 -49.00	   48.00 -51.00</p>
